              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Daudi nee geeraharuusér tlahhoó Laáwi, muu bahh'alé baraá xwaylár Asafu nee ar Hemaniwo nee ar Yedutuniwo kuna tsawaár, as gadiyér sluufmis nee tawa aaririn ar xooslaá daa'aangw adór gidaandoori nee mariímba nee mitingiraay. Múk taa tsawaár as gadiyeérí a kwí:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
