            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daaqoó Hemani a kwí: Bukia nee Matania, nee Usieli, nee Shebueli, nee Yerimoti, nee Hanania, nee Hanani, nee Eliata, nee Gidalti, nee Romamti-eseri, nee Yoshbekasha, nee Maloti, nee Hotiri, nee Mahasioti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuká' sleémeero a daaqoó Hemani, iigu'utusmoó waawutmo. Mungú Hemani guna daaqoó mibaá nee tsiyáhhií haniís nee dasu tám, adoodá' aa dirós i al'axweés as nguwa xirfayeesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín sleémeero kina geerahaár nee baabuúín, as iwa daaiya' Doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ wa ale ar mitingiray, nee ar mariímba nee ar gidaandori as iwa Mungú sagadiyuusiya' baraá do'ós wa ale. Asafu nee Yedutuni nee Hemani nin gadiyuusiyá' ar hara'ayár waawutmo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
